    "detailed_description": "NO TOMORROW is a short horror/walking simulator game. It is set in a photorealistic liminal environment.<br><br>You are stuck in a loop. Pay close attention and look for anomalies. If you feel that something is off turn back. If not keep going. Reach to floor zero as soon as you can.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><strong>Infinitely looping hallway</strong><br><br>You find yourself stuck in an infinite loop. There is only one way to escape the loop. You have to reach floor zero.<br><br><strong>Thrilling anomalies</strong><br><br>Observe your surroundings for unusual activities. If you catch an anomaly turn back immediately. If not keep going forward.<br><br><strong>Realistic</strong><br><br>Photo-realistic environments will immerse into a thrilling experience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><br>Depending on your observation skill the game can last between 20-80 minutes.",
